-Release 2.1.0 Sat March 24 2012
-        - Security fixes:
-          #2958794: CVE-2012-1148 - Memory leak in poolGrow.
-          #2895533: CVE-2012-1147 - Resource leak in readfilemap.c.
-          #3496608: CVE-2012-0876 - Hash DOS attack.
