-:class:`HDUList`, any HDU (e.g., :class:`PrimaryHDU`, :class:`ImageHDU`, etc.),
-and :class:`Card`. They are the only objects having the ``verify()`` method.
-Most other classes in `astropy.io.fits` do not have a ``verify()`` method.
