-header by supplying the checksum keyword argument with a value of 'datasum'.
-
-Examples
---------
-
-..
-  EXAMPLE START
-  Verification Using the FITS Checksum Keyword Convention
-
-To verify the checksum values for HDUs when opening a file::
-
