-    plt.plot(x, g3(x), 'k-')
@@ -99 +14,0 @@ function in which the resulting mean (variance) is the sum of the means
-.. _compound-models:
@@ -101,243 +15,0 @@ function in which the resulting mean (variance) is the sum of the means
