-    <Quantity 2.6429114293019694e-12 ph / (cm2 Hz s)>
-    >>> (1.5 * u.Jy).to(u.photon / u.cm**2 / u.s / u.micron,
-    ...                 equivalencies=u.spectral_density(3500 * u.AA))  # doctest: +FLOAT_CMP
