-``'hh:mm:ss.s'``      ``'1h01m34.1s'``
-``'hh:mm:ss.ssss'``   ``'1h01m34.1354s'``
-``'d'``               ``'15'``
-``'d.d'``             ``'15.4'``
-``'d.dd'``            ``'15.39'``
-``'d.ddd'``           ``'15.392'``
-``'m'``               ``'924'``
